{"id":"b49399dd5e084e77","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Clopen Base","display":"df-zfc-top3-clopen-base — ZFC Top3 Clopen Base","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-clopen-base — ZFC Top3 Clopen Base","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-clopen-base — ZFC Top3 Clopen Base"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6f6b2f3565aebf58\" href=\"?note=6f6b2f3565aebf58\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (topology candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (base candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\\)</span> (topological-base predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S\\)</span> (clopen-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6f6b2f3565aebf58\" href=\"?note=6f6b2f3565aebf58\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}clopen\\text{-}base}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}clopen\\text{-}base}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology and base conditions are now explicit and the clopen requirement is applied to every basic open set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6f6b2f3565aebf58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base","status":"resolved","id":"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base","status":"resolved","id":"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S$ (topological-base predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6f6b2f3565aebf58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S$ (clopen-subset predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top3-clopen-subset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}clopen\\text{-}base}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenBase}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3ClopenSubset}_S(X,\\tau,B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1197,"backlinks":[{"id":"84062f4afec5c913","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["